# libhoudini.so digest.
#
# The translator this tree ships: the stock GoogleBook Houdini 17.0 blob,
# taken from system/lib64/libhoudini.so in the GoogleBook image and shipped
# unmodified. No binary patch is applied to it.
#
# Read by tools/check-houdini-blob.sh and by the build (build.sh calls the
# checker before it builds the image), so the image can never ship a
# translator other than the one recorded here.
